  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Мод позволяет сущностям ниже:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Охранника из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guard Villagers</a>;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Арбалетчика из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Recruits</a>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">применять огнестрельное оружие в:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CGM</a>;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod-unofficial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CGMu</a> (1.20.1+);</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classic-guns-tac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics</a> (1.18.2).</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">ВНИМАНИЕ</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Вы <span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>МОЖЕТЕ</strong></span> свободно добавлять данный мод в свои модпаки.</span></p>",
